on was used to reduce the confidence interval.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"clusters were selected using the proportionate-to-population size sampling method.\"}, {\"loc\": \"ocr\", \"q\": \"Computed to give each cluster an equal weight in the estimation of prevalence.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The sample size for each state was calculated to yield a prevalence estimate with 5% error assuming 50% VAD prevalence.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}